# T-1425: mu combinator — contractive record body
# A recursive type with a Record body is contractive: the Record wrapper
# shields the RecursiveRef, so every path from root to self-reference passes
# through a guarding constructor. This must typecheck without errors.
[@[mu a [Cons head: Int tail: a]] [Cons head: 1 tail: [Cons head: 2 tail: []]]]
=== out
